{
    "title": "Gameram: Gaming social network",
    "description": "Gameram is a social network for everyone who plays games!\t\t\t\r\nMobile, PC, consoles or board games \u2013 everyone is welcome.\t\t\t\r\nFIND new friends and teammates - post your gaming IDs to play together, discuss games you like;\t\t\t\r\nFind gamers for multiplayer games / meet new friends or your perfect teammate, enjoy all your favorite multiplayer online or offline games and build your own game community / gaming teammates! Let's chat and play together!\t\t\t\r\nSHARE emotions from gaming with your friends - post screenshots and videos;\t\t\t\r\nChat with thousands of gamers from all over the world and make new friends! Create your own community and share the parts of your gaming live with them in our social network!\t\t\t\r\nCELEBRATE your achievements (or failures:) ), laugh together at funny moments and support each other with tips and advice. Show your stream to your fans and become more popular!\t\t\t\r\nYou will never be alone! Team up with other guys and chat with them about things that interest you!\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\u2022 Find a teammate for any multiplayer games in one swipe to chat and play with\t\t\t\r\n\u2022 Create your own gamers community using our buddy network & party feature and find new gaming friends\t\t\t\r\n\u2022 Community-rated players to find the best non-toxic teammates to play with\t\t\t\r\n\u2022 Grow and gain more exposure for your streams / streaming using our chat functionality\t\t\t\r\n\u2022 We support every genre of game from MMORPG, strategy, FPS and casual or makeover games for PlayStation, PC, Xbox, Nintendo, or Mobile. You are free to choose what you like.\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\nMatch. Chat. Team Up. Play together. Share your stream or best moments!\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\nYour feedback is vital to making the Gameram even better, so we\u2019d love to hear your thoughts: support@gameram.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Gameram is a social network for everyone who plays games!\t\t\t<br>Mobile, PC, consoles or board games \u2013 everyone is welcome.\t\t\t<br>FIND new friends and teammates - post your gaming IDs to play together, discuss games you like;\t\t\t<br>Find gamers for multiplayer games / meet new friends or your perfect teammate, enjoy all your favorite multiplayer online or offline games and build your own game community / gaming teammates! Let&#39;s chat and play together!\t\t\t<br>SHARE emotions from gaming with your friends - post screenshots and videos;\t\t\t<br>Chat with thousands of gamers from all over the world and make new friends! Create your own community and share the parts of your gaming live with them in our social network!\t\t\t<br>CELEBRATE your achievements (or failures:) ), laugh together at funny moments and support each other with tips and advice. Show your stream to your fans and become more popular!\t\t\t<br>You will never be alone! Team up with other guys and chat with them about things that interest you!\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t<br>\u2022 Find a teammate for any multiplayer games in one swipe to chat and play with\t\t\t<br>\u2022 Create your own gamers community using our buddy network &amp; party feature and find new gaming friends\t\t\t<br>\u2022 Community-rated players to find the best non-toxic teammates to play with\t\t\t<br>\u2022 Grow and gain more exposure for your streams / streaming using our chat functionality\t\t\t<br>\u2022 We support every genre of game from MMORPG, strategy, FPS and casual or makeover games for PlayStation, PC, Xbox, Nintendo, or Mobile. You are free to choose what you like.\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t<br>Match. Chat. Team Up. Play together. Share your stream or best moments!\t\t\t<br>\t\t\t<br>Your feedback is vital to making the Gameram even better, so we\u2019d love to hear your thoughts: support@gameram.com",
